u00a0\u00a0</strong><br>Each one is deadlier than the last. The only way out is through, pilot.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414290/extras/9dcb3006fee333cef4ab4f801845376e.poster.avif?t=1751909953\" width=500 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414290/extras/9dcb3006fee333cef4ab4f801845376e.webm?t=1751909953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414290/extras/9dcb3006fee333cef4ab4f801845376e.mp4?t=1751909953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>\u00a0</i><br><i>Choices made along the way will shape your entire journey with ANOMONAUT.\u00a0</i>  <br><i>However, should ANOMONAUT's ship be destroyed, your journey will <strong>end</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ANOMONAUT's current playable mission will advance each <strong>real-world</strong> day.<br>These missions will ultimately lead to an end of  ANOMONAUT's story.   <br>Think of ANOMONAUT as something we can experience in real-time.<br>Further details will be revealed closer to release. Know that accessibility is a priority.  <br>Thank you for your interest in ANOMONAUT.\u00a0 </h2>","developers":["sprout"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414290/d54dc70cc65051385d36d7cc6c89900fc2d40c32/header.jpg?t=1751909953","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3414290/765877403/3fbd08714565553055a7481a655634870f82394a/1751335858/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751909951","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_t